674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nflaWMVuhRoQ7kNvwGPxDPf&_nc_oc=AdpXdCiH9W03vAMH2HN4irMF6yv7XSTH1BOACD_q9isJjxnbaglztzOWrmtEy_wHpwk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKN7Ny3fvh5tINAXPKJVCr4hpDqZ6w7QYwPg-0bv_wKoA&oe=6AB685D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-7_0hjLvTh4Q7kNvwG_Gu0u&_nc_oc=AdoVPBnwh9RQGp-3RKIFrzWSt8-BU_3VfBWnmlZLpXnbWArHpVWMkQas80u8oaWAp4w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK9OdM2vFbdl1UtdSmwo88EkaGRDUGq685xHLOWmhX7OA&oe=6AB68E96"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QsZXoVcMZjQQ7kNvwF59c-Y&_nc_oc=Adqnprhl5uVROXFLlzL4DUJVsgM4sCLT6T1uOMiGfkj9f9s3y6acpEJDkpaXlpGU6wc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIWkZMldOx2q_oWpZ7CI78QTXd6M7a-l0JVk92IUi7acQ&oe=6AB68AB1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip